# Emeritus of Truce: "target player creates a 1/1 ... Inkling". Bot1 targets Bot2 with the enters ability on turn 3 and Bot2
# answers with Dawn's Truce (a Plains and a Mox Pearl held up since turn 2): its player gains hexproof, the only target
# is illegal and the whole ability does nothing (CR 608.2b): no Inkling is made for anyone, and the "then if an opponent
# controls more creatures" part is not carried out, so Emeritus does not become prepared (Bot2 controls no creature).

